.TH V2_SCALE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
v2_scale \- Multiply both components by s
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "Vec2 v2_scale(Vec2 a, float s);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Multiply both components by s. Scale a direction to a speed, a velocity to a displacement (times dt), or negate with \-1.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a * s.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR v2_norm (3),
.BR v2_add (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
